fin(s,'Printed page 244: “ترک جمہوریہ شمالی قبرص” with six paragraphs (the announcement of 15 November 1983, the constitution of 1960, 1963–64, 1974, 1975 and 1983) and the first paragraph of “چیچنیا”. Dates and figures are read as printed; the heading text and some word forms are as printed. The scan is slightly skewed.')
